# Build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.astro
**/dist
**/coverage

# Compose runtime secrets — must not enter any build context
**/.env
**/auth.env
**/media.env
**/worker.env
**/test.env
**/grafana.env
**/keys/
**/traefik/certs/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt

# Compose runtime data directories
docker_compose/**/db_data
docker_compose/**/grafana/data
docker_compose/**/minio/data
docker_compose/**/prometheus/data
docker_compose/**/redis/redis_data
docker_compose/**/media_redis/data
**/shared_migrations/

# Python tooling artifacts (compose test/tooling dirs)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage

# Version control and IDE
.git
.github
.vscode

# Local-only developer config
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
